y"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on Lancaster County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them. In 2025 that pair hit 33% of normal on the middle of the grids, while July to August reached 139%. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 30% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 24733 had its driest year in 1955 at 57%.</p>"}
